      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seconding this. As an avatar creator, there are some people I do not want using my avatars in general, and sometimes there are avatars I upload for specific people that I don't want anyone else using, but the only real option I have for either is just adding a password system to my avatar, which can lead to syncing issues and is an overall hassle.\n\nI imagine this system would instead work as a global blacklist for all your avatars, and a specific whitelist for individual avatars.",
